{
"file": 548,
"paths": [
"d008/d031/f032"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "3a3cc39a",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "41ca56e5",
"en_raw": "May I ask?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "8c299985",
"en_raw": "About the fire"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "e9c8f839",
"en_raw": "where the fire was near here?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "a55df6ed",
"en_raw": "It's behind the Waterworks Bureau on this street"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "51a26f67",
"en_raw": "Um, that fire"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "45e3e9ab",
"en_raw": "how much burned?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "7a878153",
"en_raw": "Oh, burned to the ground"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "edb01c04",
"en_raw": "It's a wonder the fire"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "b783a6c7",
"en_raw": "didn't spread"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "57981ca8",
"en_raw": "Luckily it was the rainy season"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "5655fcd6",
"en_raw": "Did you see the fire?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "74d227ec",
"en_raw": "It had been raining since morning,"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "96fca0aa",
"en_raw": "and when the fire engine sirens woke me"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "04d676b6",
"en_raw": "smoke was billowing up"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "fcfa77ff",
"en_raw": "over this whole area with great force..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "9968b4b5",
"en_raw": "I rushed over too"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "a0e6bdcf",
"en_raw": "I've said quite a lot"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "f434d7e8",
"en_raw": "don't go in on a stroll"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "e02f4426",
"en_raw": "It used to be someone's home"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "03942332",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "ced7a98f",
"en_raw": "If we're done, I'll excuse myself"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "e333a75e",
"en_raw": "Thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "680ac39d",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, um..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "852b56c9",
"en_raw": "At that fire"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "ff80daad",
"en_raw": "were there any victims?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b4b113d3",
"en_raw": "...Victims?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "fa71d7da",
"en_raw": "Yes, specifically"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "905d9f3b",
"en_raw": "whether anyone died"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "34526aea",
"en_raw": "is what I mean"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "e0f4fb8f",
"en_raw": "Please stop"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8520bfef",
"en_raw": "that's bad luck..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "6a2579e6",
"en_raw": "Bad luck, you say..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "f16e6091",
"en_raw": "Does that mean someone"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "850a67bd",
"en_raw": "died...?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "9782f9db",
"en_raw": "I told you to stop"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "276b0408",
"en_raw": "didn't I?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e8be2d10",
"en_raw": "You shouldn't say such things"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2daf2ce5",
"en_raw": "in a loud voice"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "b6cd1b2c",
"en_raw": "I just want to know"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "f379f485",
"en_raw": "the truth"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "4ba8c36b",
"en_raw": "The truth?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "0392980f",
"en_raw": "There's a rumor you can hear"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "033f4f44",
"en_raw": "a child who died in the fire"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "31097812",
"en_raw": "Oh, how awful"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "3587ddfb",
"en_raw": "that kind of story..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "fdf3b235",
"en_raw": "I don't know the details either"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "ec840f9b",
"en_raw": "it's just..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "32a27f09",
"en_raw": "They apparently can't find"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "5ebfb641",
"en_raw": "the cause of the fire"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "a0dd8fa8",
"en_raw": "and so the insurance won't pay"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "02f19755",
"en_raw": "and they're in a dispute now"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2b1e727e",
"en_raw": "So until the mess is settled"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c9c8f009",
"en_raw": "they've apparently decided"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "aad21b83",
"en_raw": "to leave the fire site alone..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "36567d76",
"en_raw": "So maybe that's why"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "c688237b",
"en_raw": "such rumors start"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "c80388aa",
"en_raw": "...Hmm"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "68b953cd",
"en_raw": "So you don't know"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "f16b15c5",
"en_raw": "if anyone died?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "0d74e4dd",
"en_raw": "I told you to stop"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "7d3718dd",
"en_raw": "that, didn't I!"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "7d2e2a58",
"en_raw": "Don't go spreading"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "9729cccb",
"en_raw": "strange things around"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "778e53d0",
"en_raw": "Nao, I got the incense"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b0997054",
"en_raw": "That's the stolen one, right?"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "36cc381f",
"en_raw": "That's a terrible thing to say"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "c55c8eaf",
"en_raw": "I properly paid after that!"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "057c9a4c",
"en_raw": "I got a lecture"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "7f1f62dc",
"en_raw": "from some old lady"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "6d0b4c47",
"en_raw": "Hey, everyone's sneaky!"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "e7eeea2d",
"en_raw": "No good, only Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "5cc1b9bf",
"en_raw": "has nothing at all"
}
]
}